    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve found the specific bench that Sasse was\nlooking for!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190076006500200066006F0075006E00640020007400680065002000730070006500630069006600690063002000620065006E00630068002000740068006100740020005300610073007300650020007700610073000A006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066006F007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s got the two planters in a row! The same\nbuildings in the background! And the mountains!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This has to be where Canari took her photo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000680061007300200074006F002000620065002000770068006500720065002000430061006E00610072006900200074006F006F006B0020006800650072002000700068006F0074006F002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’mon, no time to waste!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006D006F006E002C0020006E006F002000740069006D006500200074006F002000770061007300740065002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t I look just like Canari, sitting here on the\nsame bench she sat on?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can I ask just one more teeny tiny thing of you,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCan you take a picture of me looking just like\nCanari did in the photo I showed you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want it to be from exactly the same angle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E007400200069007400200074006F002000620065002000660072006F006D002000650078006100630074006C00790020007400680065002000730061006D006500200061006E0067006C0065002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can show you Canari’s picture again anytime,\nso let me know if you want to!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you want to check Canari’s photograph?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F00200063006800650063006B002000430061006E00610072006920190073002000700068006F0074006F00670072006100700068003F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I absolutely do!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006100620073006F006C007500740065006C007900200064006F002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not really<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200650061006C006C007900100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go on! Try to create a little distance and get me a\npicture just like Canari’s!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, I think you’ve got it! The right place should\nbe somewhere around there...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Or maybe not.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe angle’s off, isn’t it? I really want it to be the\nperfect recreation of Canari’s shot!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes! There! Take a picture from right there!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590065007300210020005400680065007200650021002000540061006B00650020006100200070006900630074007500720065002000660072006F006D002000720069006700680074002000740068006500720065002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right, let’s see if you managed to pull it off...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002C0020006C0065007420190073002000730065006500200069006600200079006F00750020006D0061006E006100670065006400200074006F002000700075006C006C0020006900740020006F00660066002E002E002E00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ohmygosh! It’s PERFECT! I look JUST like Canari!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068006D00790067006F00730068002100200049007420190073002000500045005200460045004300540021002000490020006C006F006F006B0020004A0055005300540020006C0069006B0065002000430061006E006100720069002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m uploading now, aaand... There! It’s up!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D002000750070006C006F006100640069006E00670020006E006F0077002C0020006100610061006E0064002E002E002E002000540068006500720065002100200049007420190073002000750070002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, I wonder who took that picture for Canari?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCould it be that mysterious manager of hers?\nApparently he’s really involved in her work...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess we have him to thank for having Canari\nBread and everything.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey’re not bad! But I’d really rather have Canari\nkey chains or...oooh, an acrylic standee!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe someday! Anyway, I’d love to re-create a\nbunch more of Canari’s pics while I’m in Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Thanks for your help, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\nMaybe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nseat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\non<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbench<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntake<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nload off!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See you around!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065006500200079006F0075002000610072006F0075006E0064002100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
